reviews.review:
As it stands at the early access release, I can not recommend this game for its price tag. 
The Good: 
-Some aspects feel like an improvement to drg, like the faster drone and some of the guns feel less clunky;
-The rogue like elements fit well even though some upgrades are underwhelming;
It would be fun if not for
The bad: 
-That timer is removing years from my life. It has been some time since a game mechanic has felt so frustrating and unfun. Either make us mine and deposit stuff or make everything streamlined. As of now you do not have time to complete even one extra event;
-Solo play is a nightmare since even thought you have the bot to help you, you still have to do all operations yourself, depositing, interacting, opening ammo;
-These corespawn enemies have nothing fun going for them.

There are some other issues but those can be expected in an early access.
